	"descriptionMarkdown": "Blueprint Book with 6 Blueprints for Building a Chunk-Aligned RHD Railway-System.\nIf you always build in Chunks (Hit F4 to toggle \"show grid\") you can build from different Directions and the Parts always match.\n\nThe Modules are:\n - Straigt\n - Curve\n - T-Junction\n - Turn-Arround\n - Cross\n - Save-Railway-Crossing\n\nThe Parts Straight, Curve and T-Junction are pastable over each other which makes extending an existing Rail easy.\n\nWith the Railway an electric Network is laid out and red/green wires are pre-connected to make it easy to build a central circuit network.\n\nThis Blueprint-Book is part of the [Chunk-aligned modular railway system with LTN Stations](https://forums.factorio.com/viewtopic.php?f=194&t=47773  \"Thread with more examples and descriptions\") Thread in the Factorio-Forum.\n",
